"An IBM Quantum account and API token (see [Set up your IBM Cloud&reg; "
"account](/guides/cloud-setup) for instructions)\n"
msgstr ""
"Uma conta IBM Quantum e token de API (consulte [Configurar sua conta IBM "
"Cloud&reg;](/guides/cloud-setup) para instruções)\n"

