#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "For the Qiskit Runtime, or Qiskit IBM Transpiler MCP Servers:\n"
msgstr "Para os Servidores MCP do Qiskit Runtime ou Qiskit IBM Transpiler:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"You can find your API token in your [IBM Quantum account "
